@startuml
layout compact
actor fan: Fan
box "Trip Website"
participant checkout: CheckoutController
participant pricer: TripPricer
participant guard: AvailabilityGuard
end box
box "Order Processing Center"
participant po: PurchaseOrderService
end box
box "Other organizations" <<external>>
participant bank: Bank
participant boxOffice: BoxOffice
participant experiences: ExperienceProvider
end box
note right of fan
{Book now to Order received ≤ 2 s}
end note
fan -> checkout: submit(fan, cart, cardToken)
activate checkout
checkout -> bank: validate(cardToken, 0)
activate bank
bank --> checkout: valid
deactivate bank
note right of bank
validate: 300 ms (stubs/bank.py:5).
requires_valid_card makes this call
before submit runs
(services/website/payments.py:9,
services/website/checkout.py:44).
end note
checkout -> pricer: price(cart)
activate pricer
loop [for each attendee]
pricer -> boxOffice: quote(festivalId, ageGroup)
activate boxOffice
boxOffice --> pricer: price
deactivate boxOffice
end
note right of boxOffice
quote: 1,100 ms per call
(stubs/box_office.py:9).
The box office also quotes several
passes in one call, quotes(festivalId,
ageGroups): 400 ms
(stubs/box_office.py:10,
services/website/clients.py:40).
end note
pricer --> checkout: quote
deactivate pricer
checkout -> guard: check(cart)
activate guard
loop [for each experience]
guard -> experiences: capacity(experienceId, count)
activate experiences
experiences --> guard: available
deactivate experiences
end
note left of experiences
capacity: 600 ms, 750 ms, and 900 ms
for the three Lakeside Fest experiences
(stubs/experiences.py:18,
stubs/experiences.py:19,
stubs/experiences.py:20).
end note
guard --> checkout
deactivate guard
checkout -> po: submit(tripOrder)
activate po
po --> checkout: orderId
deactivate po
note right of po
submit: 200 ms
(services/opc/service.py:27).
Catalog DB queries, not drawn: 20 ms
each, for the festival and each cart
line (devstack.py:36).
end note
checkout --> fan: Order received
deactivate checkout
note right of fan
Key: UML 2.5.1 sequence diagram.
Filled arrowhead: synchronous call.
Dashed arrow: reply.
{…} in a note: a duration constraint.
end note
@enduml
